WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:06.446
Detective Smith scratched his head and said, "You know this pig?"

2
00:00:06.447 --> 00:00:12.100
"I do," Wukong said, banging on the bars. "Wake up, lazy!"

3
00:00:12.101 --> 00:00:15.854
Bajie popped up and fell off his cot.

4
00:00:15.855 --> 00:00:21.473
"Ouch!" He looked around. "Who woke me up?"

5
00:00:21.474 --> 00:00:27.448
Wukong laughed.

6
00:00:27.449 --> 00:00:31.954
"Ha-ha, Wukong," Bajie said, pretending to laugh.

7
00:00:31.955 --> 00:00:35.394
"Did you come to this world just to laugh at me?"

8
00:00:35.395 --> 00:00:39.864
"I came here to find you," Wukong said, turning to Detective Smith.

9
00:00:39.865 --> 00:00:42.508
"Why is Bajie in jail?"

10
00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:46.073
"He's a thief," Detective Smith replied.

11
00:00:46.074 --> 00:00:49.106
"I don't believe that," Wukong said.

12
00:00:49.107 --> 00:00:52.624
"He's trying to be good and knows stealing is bad."

13
00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:56.254
"He stole a lot of food," the detective said.

14
00:00:56.255 --> 00:01:00.556
"He ate it and refused to pay for it."

15
00:01:00.557 --> 00:01:03.481
"Oh, okay." Wukong nodded.

16
00:01:03.482 --> 00:01:05.809
"I believe that, but you can let him out now. We

17
00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:09.236
need to get back to our friends." Detective

18
00:01:09.237 --> 00:01:15.053
Smith shook his head. "I can't let Bajie leave jail." "Excuse

19
00:01:15.054 --> 00:01:17.975
me?" Wukong said. "He

20
00:01:17.976 --> 00:01:22.313
broke the law." Detective Smith folded his arms. "I

21
00:01:22.314 --> 00:01:27.504
can't let him out." ***

22
00:01:27.505 --> 00:01:31.833
"I wonder where Roxy is," Mara said to Jack and Terrell.

23
00:01:31.834 --> 00:01:35.859
The three friends were at Jack's house, playing games on their phones.

24
00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:39.531
"I hope Roxy is okay," Jack said.

25
00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:41.788
Terrell didn't say anything.

26
00:01:41.789 --> 00:01:45.836
He knew Roxy had left yesterday evening to do Rocket Girl stuff.

27
00:01:45.837 --> 00:01:49.358
But none of them had heard from her since then.

28
00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:52.860
Just then Mara's phone beeped.

29
00:01:52.861 --> 00:01:57.172
"Check out this incredible news alert," she said.

30
00:01:57.173 --> 00:02:01.987
"The pig that Rocket Girl was fighting yesterday just broke out of jail.

31
00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:05.254
A talking monkey helped him!"

32
00:02:05.255 --> 00:02:09.293
"Really?" Terrell leaned over to see the alert.

33
00:02:09.294 --> 00:02:12.922
"Look—there's a video," Jack said.

34
00:02:12.923 --> 00:02:18.826
Mara clicked on the video, and they watched one side of Metro City Jail explode.

35
00:02:18.827 --> 00:02:23.211
Then the pig leaped out, followed by a monkey.

36
00:02:23.212 --> 00:02:27.787
The monkey twirled a bar in the air and did flips.

37
00:02:27.788 --> 00:02:32.340
Together he and the pig leaped onto a cloud and flew away.

38
00:02:32.341 --> 00:02:40.724
Jack's mouth hung open. "That monkey is so cool!"

39
00:02:40.725 --> 00:02:45.479
*** Roxy stared at the ugly demon. "Who are

40
00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:50.580
you?" "I'm the Demon of Black Rain," he

41
00:02:50.581 --> 00:02:56.233
replied. "And I'm honored to have a powerful goddess like you as a

42
00:02:56.234 --> 00:03:01.519
guest." Roxy was confused. "Why do you think I'm a

43
00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:06.671
goddess?" "You have amazing powers," the demon

44
00:03:06.672 --> 00:03:13.672
said. Roxy nodded. "That's true, but I'm not a

45
00:03:13.673 --> 00:03:19.042
goddess." "One of my prisoners is the Tang Monk," the demon went on.

46
00:03:19.043 --> 00:03:22.677
"I'm willing to share him with you."

47
00:03:22.678 --> 00:03:28.735
"Who's the Tang Monk?" Roxy asked. "And what do you mean by 'share'?"

48
00:03:28.736 --> 00:03:35.036
"He's an important monk," the demon said, a grin spreading across his face.

49
00:03:35.037 --> 00:03:40.115
"Anyone who eats him will live forever!"

50
00:03:40.116 --> 00:03:46.444
"You're evil," Roxy said, "and I'm going to free those prisoners right now!"

51
00:03:46.445 --> 00:03:49.215
She rushed toward a door.

52
00:03:49.216 --> 00:03:57.773
"Don't you dare!" the demon roared, leaping in front of Roxy to block her path.

53
00:03:57.774 --> 00:04:01.232
Roxy made a fist.

54
00:04:01.233 --> 00:04:07.278
Whoosh! Wind and rain swept through the cave, knocking Roxy off her feet.

55
00:04:07.279 --> 00:04:14.258
"Ahh!" Roxy tumbled through the air and slammed into walls.

56
00:04:14.259 --> 00:04:19.624
The wind carried her out of the cave and into the morning sunlight.

57
00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:22.902
Finally she crashed into a shrub.

58
00:04:22.903 --> 00:04:31.899
Bang! The cave's door slammed shut.

